    "sub_name": "市區道路工程規劃設計",
    "sub_ename": "URBAN STREETS PLANNING AND DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "闡明市區道路之功能特性，進而教導如何規劃設計。",
    "describe_eh": "To introduce the function and character of Urban Streets，and to learn how to planning and design.",
